{"s":"PYPL","updated":"2026-10-18T02:58:04.686421+00:00","profile":{"name":"PayPal Holdings, Inc.","summary":"PayPal Holdings, Inc. operates a technology platform that enables digital payments for merchants and consumers worldwide. The company operates a two-sided network at scale that connects merchants and consumers that enables its customers to connect, transact, and send and receive payments through online and in person, as well as transfer and withdraw funds using various funding sources, such as bank accounts, PayPal or Venmo account balance, consumer credit and debit products, credit and debit cards, and cryptocurrencies, as well as other stored value products, including gift cards and eligible rewards. It provides payment solutions under the PayPal, PayPal Credit, Braintree, Venmo, Xoom, Hyperwallet, Honey, and Paidy names. The company was founded in 1998 and is headquartered in San Jose, California.","industry":"Credit Services","sector":"Financial Services","employees":23800,"address":"2211 North First Street, San Jose, CA 95131, United States","phone":"408 967 7000","website":"https://www.paypal.com","exchange":"NasdaqGS","officers":[{"n":"Mr. Enrique J. Lores","t":"President, CEO & Director","age":59,"pay":167534},{"n":"Ms. Jamie S. Miller","t":"Chief Financial & Operating Officer and Executive VP","age":56,"pay":1934206},{"n":"Mr. Frank Keller","t":"President of Checkout Solutions & PayPal","age":51,"pay":1766568},{"n":"Ms. Suzan Bulyaba Kereere","t":"President of Global Markets","age":59,"pay":1766568},{"n":"Mr. Christopher Natali","t":"Senior VP & Chief Accounting Officer","age":47},{"n":"Mr. Srinivasan Venkatesan","t":"Chief Technology Officer","age":54},{"n":"Mr. Steven Eric Winoker","t":"Chief Investor Relations Officer"},{"n":"Mr. Bimal Patel","t":"Chief Legal Officer"},{"n":"Ms. Amy Bonitatibus","t":"Chief Corporate Affairs & Communications Officer"},{"n":"Mr. Antonio J. Lucio","t":"Chief Marketing & Corporate Affairs Officer","age":66}]},"stats"